# 📡 Cisco Packet Tracer: Home Wireless Router & Client Configuration

A hands-on networking lab demonstrating the deployment, hardening, and verification of a SOHO (Small Office/Home Office) network using Cisco Packet Tracer. This project covers physical cabling across a residential layout, SOHO wireless router setup, WPA2-Personal security implementation, DHCP scope allocation, and end-to-end ICMP/HTTP network verification.

---

## 📐 Physical Layout Overview

The lab represents a residential environment with connected devices spanning across multiple rooms, fed by an external Cable TV/ISP feed through a coaxial connection.

