### Phase 3: Connectivity Verification (ICMP Ping Tests)

To verify cross-network routing and local communication between subnets, ICMP echo requests were transmitted between the **Office PC** (`192.168.0.3`) and the **Bedroom PC** (`192.168.0.4`). Both hosts achieved 0% packet loss with sub-millisecond latency.

